as-inline-color has-gray-dark-color\">Gloria Armah, Senior lecturer, Department of Mathematics Education, University of Education Winneba<\/mark><\/strong><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-style-rounded\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"708\" height=\"914\" src=\"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2025\/04\/John_Afrim.jpeg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-12585\" srcset=\"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2025\/04\/John_Afrim.jpeg 708w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2025\/04\/John_Afrim-232x300.jpeg 232w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2025\/04\/John_Afrim-9x12.jpeg 9w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 708px) 100vw, 708px\" \/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:#fff\" class=\"has-inline-color has-gray-dark-color\">John Afrim, Mathematics Tutor,<br>International Baccalaureate Specialization<\/mark><\/strong><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large is-style-rounded\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"909\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2025\/04\/angela_tabiri_profile_picture-edited-2048x2048-1-909x1024-3.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-12582\" srcset=\"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2025\/04\/angela_tabiri_profile_picture-edited-2048x2048-1-909x1024-3.jpg 909w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2025\/04\/angela_tabiri_profile_picture-edited-2048x2048-1-909x1024-3-266x300.jpg 266w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2025\/04\/angela_tabiri_profile_picture-edited-2048x2048-1-909x1024-3-768x865.jpg 768w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2025\/04\/angela_tabiri_profile_picture-edited-2048x2048-1-909x1024-3-11x12.jpg 11w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 909px) 100vw, 909px\" \/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"><strong><mark style=\"background-color:#fff\" class=\"has-inline-color has-gray-dark-color\">Angela Tabiri, Academic Manager and Research Associate, AIMS Ghana<\/mark><\/strong><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"513\" height=\"586\" src=\"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2025\/03\/White-blank.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-12557\" srcset=\"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2025\/03\/White-blank.png 513w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2025\/03\/White-blank-263x300.png 263w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2025\/03\/White-blank-11x12.png 11w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 513px) 100vw, 513px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/figure>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-advgb-tab advgb-tab-body-container\"><div class=\"advgb-tab-body-header advgb-tab-class-\">Application Information<\/div><div class=\"advgb-tab-_2cc718-ff advgb-tab-body\" aria-labelledby=\"advgb-tabs-tab4\">\n<h3>Helping Teachers Teach Mathematics Conference -HTTMC <\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-normal-font-size\"><strong>Eligibility:<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Applicants must be Mathematics and Computer Science teachers at the Junior or Senior high school level ie. Grades 7-12 who will be available to participate either online\/ in-person within the stated period. <strong style=\"color:red\"> <\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-color\" style=\"color:#e43546\"><strong style=\"color:red\">DEADLINE FOR APPLICATIONS:<\/strong> <strong>10th April 2025<\/strong><br><strong><br>Application Form:<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Click <a rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" href=\"https:\/\/docs.google.com\/forms\/d\/e\/1FAIpQLSdwkq-kZadEn1LHE-rSVh-akUyV0Vai6g45EoqXfrhUh-VsqQ\/viewform\" target=\"_blank\">HERE <\/a> to complete the Online Form.<br><\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>For more information, kindly send an email to organizers at&nbsp;<strong>httmc@aims.edu.gh<\/strong>. The subject of your email should have your full name and the abbreviations of the conference: HTTMC as shown in the example:&nbsp;<span style=\"color:blue\">Kwesi.Ofori.HTTMC2024.<\/span><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Kindly note that only shortlisted applicants will be contacted.<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Click to download Application Flyer<\/p>\n\n\n\n\n\n<a class=\"btn-download bg-alt\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2025\/03\/HHTMC-Call-Poster-2025-2.png\"> Download <\/a>\n\n\n\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-advgb-tab advgb-tab-body-container pad-5-no-top\"><div class=\"advgb-tab-body-header advgb-tab-class-undefined\">Schedule<\/div><div class=\"advgb-tab-_92d0c8-31 advgb-tab-body\" aria-labelledby=\"advgb-tabs-tab5\">\n<h3>Helping Teachers Teach Mathematics Conference -HTTMC <\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p> Conference schedule is currently being finalized. <\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Click to download tentative schedule.<\/p>\n\n\n\n\n\n<a class=\"btn-download bg-alt\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2025\/03\/HTTMC-2025-Notepad-v2-1.pdf\"> Download <\/a>\n\n\n\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-advgb-tab advgb-tab-body-container pad-5-no-top\"><div class=\"advgb-tab-body-header advgb-tab-class-undefined\">Travel Guide <\/div><div class=\"advgb-tab-_c616af-7d advgb-tab-body\" aria-labelledby=\"advgb-tabs-tab6\">\n<h2 id=\"block-f448c087-a308-4b21-b4d8-185035e6d127\">Travel Guide<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p id=\"block-bb8fef3d-47fa-4808-af9b-273f2f6b30ce\"><strong>Routine Vaccines<\/strong>:<br>Be sure that your routine vaccines, as per your province or territory, are up-to-date.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p id=\"block-3da2f657-7f7d-41e3-8146-bdcb74d3d83b\">Some of these vaccines include: measles-mumps-rubella (MMR), diphtheria, tetanus, pertussis, polio, varicella (chickenpox), influenza and others.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p id=\"block-5881ae13-4b07-4cdc-b96d-4bf0bfd60212\"><strong>Pre-travel vaccines and medications<\/strong>:<br>You may be at risk for preventable diseases while travelling to this destination. Talk to a travel health professional about which medications or vaccines are right for you.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p id=\"block-64c88815-0799-497f-9688-c49126d428b9\"><strong>Diseases include<\/strong>:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p id=\"block-50456245-a778-49b5-86b1-5e396031a4dd\">Hepatitis A<br>Yellow Fever &#8211; Country Entry Requirements<br>Rabies<br>Measles<br>Hepatitis B<br>Polio<br>Influenza<br>Meningococcal disease<br>Malaria<br>COVID-19<br>Food and Water-borne Diseases<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p id=\"block-4e56f9a0-a6cf-4cd9-8931-a54784805116\"><strong>Travel health and safety<\/strong>:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p id=\"block-494aa6f3-3e37-4f07-90be-5c40adfd831d\"><strong>Emergency medical attention and serious illnesses require medical evacuation. Medical services usually require immediate cash payment.<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p id=\"block-b3d59b32-b2b6-4a31-a062-874fac47f960\"><strong>Make sure you get travel insurance that includes coverage for medical evacuation and hospital stays<\/strong>.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p id=\"block-ec29dfbe-b6e5-4e23-b2a2-bd3e918de688\"><strong>Prescription drugs<br>If you take prescription medication, you are responsible for determining its legality in Ghana.<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p id=\"block-7c5a01e2-0669-4c73-907d-a7e93f8d82ea\"><strong>Precautions<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Bring sufficient quantities of your medication with you<\/strong><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Always keep your medication in the original container<\/strong><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Carry a copy of your prescription(s)<\/strong><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Pack them in your carry-on luggage<\/strong><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><mark class=\"has-inline-color has-red-color\"><strong>COVID-19<\/strong> <strong>Protocol at AIMS Ghana<\/strong><\/mark><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>AIMS Ghana adopts recommendations&nbsp;from National Covid 19 guidelines, so the main protocol is that anyone visiting Ghana or the Centre is required to be fully vaccinated.&nbsp;All participants should kindly adhere to this protocol.<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\" id=\"block-4300b029-f898-4661-bafb-f09cbf45bfb2\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2022\/08\/Travel-Guidelines-1-1-647x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" \/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">\ufeff<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image is-resized\" id=\"block-5b6d64e8-a87b-4131-918c-14ddb1558f68\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2022\/08\/Travel-Guidelines-2-1-841x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"798\" height=\"971\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"is-layout-flow wp-block-group pad-2-10\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container\">\n<div class=\"is-layout-flex wp-container-12 wp-block-columns\">\n<div class=\"is-layout-flow wp-block-column\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"627\" height=\"230\" src=\"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2022\/12\/AIMS-GHANA.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-7921\" srcset=\"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2022\/12\/AIMS-GHANA.png 627w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2022\/12\/AIMS-GHANA-300x110.png 300w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2022\/12\/AIMS-GHANA-18x7.png 18w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 627px) 100vw, 627px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"is-layout-flow wp-block-column\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"305\" height=\"165\" src=\"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2022\/12\/UWATERLOO.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-7923\" srcset=\"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2022\/12\/UWATERLOO.png 305w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2022\/12\/UWATERLOO-300x162.png 300w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2022\/12\/UWATERLOO-18x10.png 18w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 305px) 100vw, 305px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"is-layout-flow wp-block-column\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"298\" height=\"169\" src=\"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2022\/12\/CEMC.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-7922\" srcset=\"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2022\/12\/CEMC.png 298w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2022\/12\/CEMC-18x10.png 18w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 298px) 100vw, 298px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<style class=\"advgb-styles-renderer\">.advgb-tabs-db1d1e16-1b09-450c-bd74-db70c40817dd ul.advgb-tabs-panel li.advgb-tab.advgb-tab-active {background-color:#dc3545 !important;color:#fff !important;}#advgb-tabs-db1d1e16-1b09-450c-bd74-db70c40817dd .advgb-tab-body-header.header-active, .advgb-tabs-db1d1e16-1b09-450c-bd74-db70c40817dd .advgb-tab-body-header.header-active{background-color:#dc3545 !important;color:#fff !important;}<\/style>","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"","protected":false},"author":10,"featured_media":12234,"parent":0,"template":"","meta":{"advgb_blocks_editor_width":"","advgb_blocks_columns_visual_guide":""},"tags":[],"event_types":[44],"event_times":[],"acf":[],"featured_img":"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2025\/03\/Screenshot-2025-03-07-205930.png","coauthors":[],"author_meta":{"author_link":"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/author\/charlene\/","display_name":"charlene"},"relative_dates":{"created":"Posted 9 months ago","modified":"Updated 6 months ago"},"absolute_dates":{"created":"Posted on March 7, 2025","modified":"Updated on May 14, 2025"},"absolute_dates_time":{"created":"Posted on March 7, 2025 9:07 pm","modified":"Updated on May